{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 2, "text": "13. 谷魂（hon'hau*）", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 274, "w": 346, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "13. 谷魂（hon'hau*）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 274, "w": 346, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 3, "text": "虽名为“魂”（hon'），但人们事实上是把它作为神灵来崇拜的。七月半，布依族每户", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 338, "w": 1459, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "虽名为“魂”（hon'），但人们事实上是把它作为神灵来崇拜的。七月半，布依族每户", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 338, "w": 1459, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 4, "text": "人家吃过晚饭后，都要插“路香”，点一大把香从神龛插起，经大门、梯坎一直插到大路上，", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 402, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人家吃过晚饭后，都要插“路香”，点一大把香从神龛插起，经大门、梯坎一直插到大路上，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 402, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 5, "text": "插得越远越好。此举意在接谷魂，能使谷物丰收。布依族的“尝新节”", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 467, "w": 1234, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "插得越远越好。此举意在接谷魂，能使谷物丰收。布依族的“尝新节”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 467, "w": 1234, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 6, "text": "，把将成熟的稻穗", "bbox_px": {"x": 1311, "y": 467, "w": 326, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "，把将成熟的稻穗", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1311, "y": 467, "w": 326, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 7, "text": "摘回家，蒸或煮熟后祭供，祈求谷魂早日归家，而摘谷穗回家本身以象征性行动证明主人", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 531, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "摘回家，蒸或煮熟后祭供，祈求谷魂早日归家，而摘谷穗回家本身以象征性行动证明主人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 531, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 8, "text": "已占有谷魂，谷物必定丰收无疑。布依族还有一种信仰，即认为有一种鬼魅会暗中偷食", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 595, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "已占有谷魂，谷物必定丰收无疑。布依族还有一种信仰，即认为有一种鬼魅会暗中偷食", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 595, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 9, "text": "谷魂，使谷子经不起食用。为了驱赶鬼魅，赎回谷魂，人们一般在农历七月或丧葬仪式后", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 660, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "谷魂，使谷子经不起食用。为了驱赶鬼魅，赎回谷魂，人们一般在农历七月或丧葬仪式后", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 660, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 10, "text": "举行“赎谷魂”仪式。谷魂崇拜的产生无疑是很早的，由此也可见布依族稻作文化历史的", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 719, "w": 1544, "h": 67}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "举行“赎谷魂”仪式。谷魂崇拜的产生无疑是很早的，由此也可见布依族稻作文化历史的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 719, "w": 1544, "h": 67}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 11, "text": "悠久。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 797, "w": 105, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "悠久。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 797, "w": 105, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 12, "text": "此外，还有风神、圈神、空背带神、厕所神，等等。比起上述自然神灵来，这些神的信", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 857, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此外，还有风神、圈神、空背带神、厕所神，等等。比起上述自然神灵来，这些神的信", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 857, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 13, "text": "仰范围要小些，不十分普遍。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 925, "w": 494, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "仰范围要小些，不十分普遍。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 925, "w": 494, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 14, "text": "除神灵外，摩教信仰的自然鬼灵精怪也较多，它们均有自己的活动范围。简述如下：", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 986, "w": 1455, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "除神灵外，摩教信仰的自然鬼灵精怪也较多，它们均有自己的活动范围。简述如下：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 986, "w": 1455, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 15, "text": "14. 独几（tuPtgit）", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1045, "w": 306, "h": 55}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "14. 独几（tuPtgit）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1045, "w": 306, "h": 55}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 16, "text": "常以动物形态出现，有人说其形身长如羊，有粗短尾，掌似鸭，嘴似鸭；也有人说其形", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1114, "w": 1467, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "常以动物形态出现，有人说其形身长如羊，有粗短尾，掌似鸭，嘴似鸭；也有人说其形", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1114, "w": 1467, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 17, "text": "如巨鹅，在暗处会发光；也有人说其身如蟒，长如巨藤。怪异古树、石礅、幽深山谷、溪谷", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1179, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "如巨鹅，在暗处会发光；也有人说其身如蟒，长如巨藤。怪异古树、石礅、幽深山谷、溪谷", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1179, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 18, "text": "均可能被认为有“独几”。凡被认为有“独几”之处，忌大小便、吐痰、开玩笑等。其作祟会", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1239, "w": 1552, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "均可能被认为有“独几”。凡被认为有“独几”之处，忌大小便、吐痰、开玩笑等。其作祟会", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1239, "w": 1552, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 19, "text": "使人生病。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1311, "w": 189, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "使人生病。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1311, "w": 189, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 20, "text": "15. 独养（tu'？jam*）", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1372, "w": 342, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "15. 独养（tu'？jam*）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1372, "w": 342, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 21, "text": "又叫“独奢”（tu’sei’）、“独拉”（tu?dap？）等。被认为是妇女与其他男人发生婚前、婚", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1432, "w": 1463, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "又叫“独奢”（tu’sei’）、“独拉”（tu?dap？）等。被认为是妇女与其他男人发生婚前、婚", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1432, "w": 1463, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 22, "text": "外性行为关系怀孕后形成的一种鬼。这种鬼附在该妇女身上，常离开其肉身到处作祟于", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1501, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "外性行为关系怀孕后形成的一种鬼。这种鬼附在该妇女身上，常离开其肉身到处作祟于", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1501, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 23, "text": "人、畜，使受害者晕厥、神志不清、胡言乱语、口吐白沫等，严重者常发生休克甚至死亡。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1565, "w": 1556, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人、畜，使受害者晕厥、神志不清、胡言乱语、口吐白沫等，严重者常发生休克甚至死亡。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1565, "w": 1556, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 24, "text": "独养作祟时一般要请布摩以巫术驱逐之。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1637, "w": 720, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "独养作祟时一般要请布摩以巫术驱逐之。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1637, "w": 720, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 25, "text": "16. 独香（tu?Dian'）", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1692, "w": 334, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "16. 独香（tu?Dian'）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1692, "w": 334, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 26, "text": "专在悬崖峭壁和水边作祟的鬼魅，与汉族的“替死鬼”相似。若受其作祟，将发生溺", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1754, "w": 1463, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "专在悬崖峭壁和水边作祟的鬼魅，与汉族的“替死鬼”相似。若受其作祟，将发生溺", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1754, "w": 1463, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 27, "text": "水或坠崖等灾祸。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1826, "w": 322, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "水或坠崖等灾祸。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1826, "w": 322, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 28, "text": "17. 独利（tu2 ）", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1885, "w": 298, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "17. 独利（tu2 ）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1885, "w": 298, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 29, "text": "此鬼作祟使人肚痛。", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1955, "w": 358, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此鬼作祟使人肚痛。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1955, "w": 358, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 30, "text": "18. 倒头沙鬼", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 2020, "w": 241, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "18. 倒头沙鬼", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 2020, "w": 241, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 31, "text": "此鬼作祟使人头昏目眩。", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2084, "w": 438, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此鬼作祟使人头昏目眩。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2084, "w": 438, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 32, "text": "19.土地鬼", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 2152, "w": 201, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "19.土地鬼", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 2152, "w": 201, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 142, "line_no": 33, "text": "此鬼作祟使人脚痛或嘴歪。", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2217, "w": 478, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此鬼作祟使人脚痛或嘴歪。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 2217, "w": 478, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
